{"content": "Reconcile with KmsFence's decision: `mode_config.funcs.atomic_commit` is
1) your fallible DSI link + DECON enable (before swap_state), 2) `drm_atomic_helper_prepare_planes(state)`, 3) `drm_atomic_helper_swap_state(...)`, 4) `exynos7580_commit_tail(state)` — never `drm_atomic_helper_commit()` (it never arms the flip event). Adaptive/nonblock uses the same tail.

