Unless the blocking is elsewhere: drm_read's wait uses `drm_core_event_wait` and O_NONBLOCK handled... Let me look at drm_read source? It's in the kernel tree; check 3.10 drm_irq.c drm_read:

```
	if (file_priv->event_space < 0) { ... }
	while (file_priv->event_head == file_priv->event_tail) {
		if (filp->f_flags & O_NONBLOCK)
